senses.gloss:
--also महेश्वर and शङ्कर; a Rudra: place of residence is शिवपुर in front of Brahmaloka; Lord of Trinity;
1: Br. III. 3. ७१; IV. ३९. १२०; M. १७१. ३९.
the अधिदेवता for the planet सूर्य;
2: M. ९३. १३.
the २६थ् तत्व on one view;
3: M. 3. २८.
being a small atom is god of love for people; in him are ten characteristics--knowledge, वैराग्य, ऐश्वर्य, तपस्, सत्य, patience, courage, quality of being seen, kinship to self and dominion; is माया or illusory;
4: वा. १०१. २१५, २१९; Br. IV. 2. २१७.
the Lord of all world.
5: वा. 4. ३६ and ४२.
[page१-207+ १२]
